## Performance Considerations

- Token validation with JWKS endpoint caching: <0.5ms after initial key fetch (cache TTL: 5 minutes)
- Token introspection vs local JWT validation: Local validation saves 2-5ms per request — prefer JWT with RS256 for stateless services
- OAuth2 scope evaluation: <0.01ms — simple Set.contains() check per scope
